  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "I keep having this dream, and in it I am some sort of barrel-shaped creature. Around me are vast, cyclopean ruins etched with bizarre carvings. I can hear this constant sound, like a wet slap or suction. And behind it all, a strange sound...TEKELI-LI!",
    "value": "我反复做着同一个梦。梦中，我变成了一种桶状的生物，置身于巨大而怪异的废墟中，周围刻满诡异的雕纹。耳边不断传来湿黏的拍打或吮吸声，而在这一切背后，还有一种奇怪的声音...泰克利-利！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "It plays like some fell flute on the wind. I wander in this strange body, towards the sound. In my...whatever passes for a hand...I hold some strange weapon or tool. And then I see it, rising from a black bit like some sort of sentient vomit plastered with a thousand visages undulating beneath the skin. Rather than run in fear, I stab at it with the device. There is a flash, and then I am awake.",
    "value": "它像某种邪恶的笛声在风中飘荡。我控制着这具陌生的身体，朝声音的方向走去。在我...姑且算是手的部位...握着一把奇怪的武器或工具。然后我看见它了，从黑暗中升起，如同某种有意识的呕吐物，皮下浮动着千百张面孔。我没有逃跑，而是用手中的器械刺向它。一道闪光之后，我惊醒了。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "Ten nights in a row I've been burdened with this strangeness. Ten nights I've woken up in a cold sweat swearing that I can hear voices in the night, musical voices whispering like some sort of conscience in the back of my mind. Yet I saw nothing. Not until tonight.",
    "value": "连续十晚，我被这诡异的梦境困扰。十个夜晚，我都在冷汗中惊醒，发誓自己听到了夜里的声音，那如音乐般的声音，如同某种良知在我脑海深处低语。可我什么也没看见。直到今晚。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/3",
    "raw": "They were outside of our camp, well beyond the sight of us due in part to the blizzard-like conditions. I was outside trying to solve the quandry with the drill when the whispers started. Frantically, I looked around for their source but could find none. I'd thought I was truly losing my mind until I noticed movement.",
    "value": "它们就在我们营地之外，因暴风雪而难以察觉。我当时正在外面解决钻机的问题，低语声忽然响起。我慌乱地四处寻找声源，却一无所获。就在我以为自己真的疯了的时候，我注意到了动静。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/4",
    "raw": "It was there, swirling its bizarre limbs about, barely noticable in the storm. I could sense it, perhaps because of my dreams...and I knew in that moment that it intended nothing good for us. As I turned to call for the others there was a shift of limb and barrel-like body...and it was gone.",
    "value": "它就在那儿，在风雪中微微摆动怪异的肢体。或许因为那些梦，我能感觉到它....并在那一刻明白，它对我们不怀好意。我刚要转身呼唤其他人，它肢体一缩，桶状的身体一晃...消失了。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/5",
    "raw": "The others won't believe me, so I opted to simply leave and investigate on my own. Besides, MacReady has clearly lost it. I'd rather not be around when he totally snaps. If I find anything interesting I'll report back.",
    "value": "其他人都不相信我，于是我决定独自离开调查。何况麦克瑞迪已经明显失常，我可不想在他彻底崩溃时还在场。如果发现什么，我会回报。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/6",
    "raw": "Well, I made it beyond the cliffs and am now staring directly at the ruins from my dream. It's covered in ice and snow, and while the details are obscured there is no mistaking it. What does this mean? Am I being called to find this place? By whom? I simply must know more. I will begin investigation in the morning.",
    "value": "我越过了悬崖，此刻正直视着梦中的废墟。它被冰雪覆盖，细节虽模糊，但绝不会错。这意味着什么？我是被召唤来此的吗？被谁？我非得了解更多不可。明早我就开始着手调查。"
  }
]